            "value": "This program moved to %1$@. It was approved at %2$@. Before: %3$@. Now: %4$@. If you did not move or update it, deny. If you approve, this file's fingerprint replaces the recorded one, and later runs of it may run without asking, as this item's settings allow."
          }
        }
      }
    },
